WEBVTT

00:40:29.470 --> 00:40:32.666
Mandy O'Neill and Nancy Rothbard
on cultures of care,

00:40:32.690 --> 00:40:35.677
and Jonathon Halbesleben and colleagues
on firefighter burnout.

00:40:35.701 --> 00:40:42.701
(Music)

00:40:45.122 --> 00:40:47.280
(Music fades out)

00:40:48.814 --> 00:40:52.676
AHP: Millennials are, in a way,
incredibly physically mobile.

00:40:52.700 --> 00:40:56.306
You have people who are moving away
from their support systems.

00:40:56.330 --> 00:40:59.753
When you're not around your parents,
you don't have that support system.

00:40:59.777 --> 00:41:03.576
AG: Some of my students have moved away
from their parents to escape burnout,